{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a relaxing City Builder set in a fantasy space world with different biomes to discover and hundreds of items to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/9eecf1115a2f375ed2bef2dd2c6bf6d1.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/9eecf1115a2f375ed2bef2dd2c6bf6d1.webm?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/9eecf1115a2f375ed2bef2dd2c6bf6d1.mp4?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create colourful forests or build farms, villages or cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build on any new moon you discover. Building brings you a vast array of colours while you mix and match building parts to make your moon city as unique as your\u00a0imagination will let it be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.webm?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/bb897656593607bd68e8753fd7052b8e.mp4?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBUS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus spawn and roam the world! This fun space species loves to hang around and have a good time!  Pet them and place special items to influence their behaviour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.webm?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/f2554274e6df7efc142161a8cb140dae.mp4?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will also appear and bring new life to your world! Collect them and unlock new species and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.webm?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/d7e393e59b1eb369c8aff2cb94df1d0c.mp4?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KIBOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot companion will be your helper during your playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibot is an old model! He is fun, handy and will be helping you out with your building or destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/63df3a2847def6a69d121d48ca48712f.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/63df3a2847def6a69d121d48ca48712f.webm?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/63df3a2847def6a69d121d48ca48712f.mp4?t=1757757430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELAXING CITY BUILDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the freedom to build at your own pace as there is no economy. <br>Just relax and enjoy creating your dream moon city!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734110?t=1757757430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/8d0ebc51ecfa56e81f97fa71ca6fffbddcebedeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757757430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/e25c211a189838e061b45c1e0b6df88f42ade49b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757757430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/e25c211a189838e061b45c1e0b6df88f42ade49b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757757430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibus Moon Rock is a relaxing City Builder set in a fantasy space world with different biomes to discover and hundreds of items to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734110/extras/9eecf1115a2f375ed2bef2dd2c6bf6d1.poster.avif?t=1757757430\" width=610 height=